dates calendar_function_renamed v1
description "The same file as ../calendar_function.cal, with the alias the note of its W001 gives; check says nothing, and every target takes it. Its own alias differs from the other file's only so that the two go through the targets side by side"
use calendar "../../fixtures/calendars/weekends.cal"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31
  n        : int   range >=0 <=3

date is_open(due) = received
  + n business days
